        },
        {
          "text": "UJowashi inkosi yakwaJuda wathatha zonke izipho ezingcwele uJehoshafati noJoramu no-Ahaziya, oyise, amakhosi akwaJuda, ababezingcwelisile, nezipho zakhe ezingcwele, nalo lonke igolide elalisengcebeni yendlu yenkosi. UJehova nasendlini yenkosi, wayithumela kuHazayeli inkosi yase-Aramu, wasuka eJerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
